#
# Counter-example for the diagnostic root-cause meta-fold: two INDEPENDENT findings
# with no gmeow:findingAntecedent chain between them. The meta-rules must derive NO
# gmeow:findingTraces, NO gmeow:findingRootCause, and NO gmeow:findingCluster — a
# finding with no antecedent chain to another finding is never assigned a root
# cause (the root-cause rule requires a traced childless antecedent). Consumed ONLY
# by crates/conformance/tests/diagnostics_meta_findings.rs. Lives under tests/ so
# the global make validate gate never loads it as data.
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix ex:    <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/diagnostics/tests/> .

ex:rcIndep1 a gmeow:Finding .
ex:rcIndep2 a gmeow:Finding .
